---
import { getEntry, render } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteUrl } from '../../utils/urls';

const entry = (await getEntry('projects', 'mr-haptic-actuator'))!;
const publication = (await getEntry('publications', 'magnetically-self-sealed-mr-haptic-actuator'))!;
const { Content } = await render(entry);
const project = entry.data;
const [setup, thermal, biomechanics] = project.gallery;
---

<BaseLayout title={project.title} description={project.summary!}>
  <article class="page-shell mr-page">
    <a href={siteUrl('/projects/')} class="back">← All projects</a>

    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Research / Haptic actuation</p>
      <h1>{project.title}</h1>
      <p class="intro">{project.subtitle}</p>
      <ul class="tags">{project.tags.map((tag) => <li>{tag}</li>)}</ul>
    </header>

    <figure class="hero">
      <img src={siteUrl(project.hero!.source)} alt={project.hero!.alt} width="1800" height="1903" fetchpriority="high" />
      <figcaption>Actuator architecture, magnetic sealing regions, multidisk working region, and PWM-controlled torque generation.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <section class="overview split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">01 / Integrated system</p>
        <h2>From magnetic circuit to rendered torque</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="body-copy"><Content /></div>
    </section>

    <section class="evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Experimental evidence</p><h2 id="evidence-title">Characterised as a complete platform</h2></div>
        <p>Values shown here are reported for the tested conditions in the linked preprint.</p>
      </div>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>10 kHz</dt><dd>Selected PWM carrier frequency in the converged low-hysteresis regime.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>77.4%</dt><dd>Reduction in average square-wave overshoot versus the PID baseline.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>1.5 h</dt><dd>Continuous periodic torque-rendering test without evident tracking loss.</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <figure>
        <img src={siteUrl(setup.source)} alt={setup.alt} width="1800" height="1688" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>{setup.caption}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="control split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">03 / Control</p>
        <h2>Compensating the nonlinear response</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>The 10 kHz open-loop response is represented by a nonlinear backbone plus residual hysteresis that changes with branch direction and rate. The real-time controller layers inverse-model feedforward, hysteresis compensation, PI feedback, and a boundary-layer sliding-mode correction.</p>
        <p>Against the PID baseline, the manuscript reports reductions of 77.4% in average square-wave overshoot, 61.9% in undershoot, and 68.3% in steady-state RMSE under the reported test conditions.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="results-grid" aria-label="Selected validation figures">
      <figure>
        <img src={siteUrl(thermal.source)} alt={thermal.alt} width="1800" height="844" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>{thermal.caption}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <img src={siteUrl(biomechanics.source)} alt={biomechanics.alt} width="1800" height="2025" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>{biomechanics.caption}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="publication" aria-labelledby="publication-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Publication</p>
      <h2 id="publication-title">{publication.data.title}</h2>
      <p>{publication.data.authors.join(', ')}</p>
      <a href={publication.data.paper} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the preprint on arXiv ↗</a>
    </section>

    <footer class="project-footer"><a href={siteUrl('/projects/')}>← Back to projects</a><span>MR fluids · Haptics · Control</span></footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .mr-page {padding-top:3rem}.back {font-size:.9rem} header {margin:3rem 0} h1 {font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6.5rem);max-width:14ch}.tags {list-style:none;display:flex;gap:.7rem 1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:1rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:2rem;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
  figure {margin:0} img {display:block;width:100%;height:auto;background:var(--soft)}figcaption {margin-top:.7rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem}.hero {max-width:62rem;margin-inline:auto}.hero img {max-height:58rem;object-fit:contain}
  h2 {font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.8rem);line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0}.split {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem)}.overview,.control {padding:5rem 0}.body-copy,.control>div:last-child {color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem}.body-copy :global(p),.control p {margin-top:0}
  .evidence {padding:3rem;background:var(--soft)}.section-heading {display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:2rem}.section-heading>p {max-width:24rem;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem}.evidence dl {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;margin:2rem 0 3rem;background:var(--line)}.evidence dl div {padding:1.5rem;background:var(--paper)}dt {font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:760;letter-spacing:-.04em}dd {margin:.3rem 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem}.evidence figure {background:var(--paper)}
  .results-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr .85fr;gap:2rem;align-items:start}.results-grid figure {padding:1rem;background:var(--soft)}
  .publication {margin-top:5rem;padding:3rem;border-top:3px solid var(--accent);background:var(--soft)}.publication h2 {max-width:44rem}.publication p {color:var(--muted)}.project-footer {display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:2rem;margin-top:4rem;font-size:.9rem}.project-footer span {color:var(--muted)}
  @media(max-width:700px){.split,.results-grid {grid-template-columns:1fr}.overview,.control {padding:3rem 0}.evidence,.publication {padding:1.25rem}.section-heading {display:block}.section-heading>p {margin-top:1rem}.evidence dl {grid-template-columns:1fr}.results-grid {gap:1.25rem}}
</style>
